  "text": "This look brings a soft, milky elegance to your frosty workday, balancing warmth and sophistication in a muted palette that stands out against the snow. The structured white silk dress acts as a clean anchor for your figure, while the five-tiered pearl necklace adds an old-Hollywood glamour without overwhelming the silhouette. The beige suede booties offer a cozy touch perfect for walking on icy streets, paired with a sturdy bag to keep you practical yet polished. Together, this outfit creates a harmonious line that draws attention to your vertical shape and graceful posture.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the belt loosely at your natural waist only if you wish to define it slightly, though leaving it unbelted keeps the dress flowing freely.",
    "Let the pearl necklace hang naturally without pinching or layering too many chains together for a balanced drape.",
    "Walk confidently in your suede boots; they’re designed for comfort during long walks on slippery roads."
  ],
