      "n": "#272·19",
      "text": "This is a graceful midi dress in creamy silk with subtle shimmering dots, cut softly along the body to skim your hips and legs without clinging. The V-neckline gently frames your collarbone, adding just enough elegance for an office setting while keeping comfort intact."
    },
    {
      "n": "#452·16",
      "text": "A layered necklace made of five strands of white pearls tied with a black bow at the top; it drapes elegantly down your chest, offering vintage charm and visual balance to your neckline."
    },
    {
      "n": "#344·39",
      "text": "This is a spacious beige leather tote bag featuring clean lines, structured shape, and a silver buckle closure that complements your outfit’s neutral tones without drawing too much attention."
    },
    {
      "n": "#409·06",
      "text": "These are cozy beige suede peep-toe boots with a low heel, designed for comfort and ease when walking in cold weather. They add a stylish yet understated edge to your ensemble."
